"An edge started with ``--config-file`` or ``sibuna lb`` serves the routes "
"of the firewall on the HTTP frontends whose surface is ``gate`` or "
"``shield``. It adds the routes below. ``cmd/sibuna/src/routes.rs``, "
"``cmd/sibuna/src/edge/probe.rs``, ``cmd/sibuna/src/acme.rs`` and "
"``crates/acme/src/server.rs`` hold them."
msgstr "Un edge arrancado con ``--config-file`` o ``sibuna lb`` sirve las rutas del firewall en los frontends HTTP cuyo modo de protección es ``gate`` o ``shield``. Añade las rutas siguientes. Están en ``cmd/sibuna/src/routes.rs``, ``cmd/sibuna/src/edge/probe.rs``, ``cmd/sibuna/src/acme.rs`` y ``crates/acme/src/server.rs``."

