#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/reference.rst:83
msgid ""
"The three routes of ``/__sibuna/`` answer a client inside "
"``observability.internal_allow`` (the loopback networks by default) whose "
"request carries no ``X-Forwarded-For``, ``X-Real-IP`` or ``Forwarded`` "
"field. Every other client receives the ``404`` of an unknown route. "
"``/__sibuna/ready`` exists on the edge only."
msgstr ""
